A("Z2061","covered","Ran the step with the exact convention of the repo (λ(p) = min over non-residues A of HJ(p/A) = 1 + Σ_{odd i} a_i). Fraction of p ≡ 1 (4) with λ(p)=2: 0.90 (100–1000), 0.84, 0.86, 0.85, 0.87 (to 3·10⁴): stable, no 1/log decay. Consistent with almost-all results (FRONTIER §2, Vaughan); the decay prediction is refuted at these scales.",["scripts/z52b_p1_U09_lambda.c","data/z52b/pass1/U09/lambda_le30000.txt","BRAINSTORM/z52b_pass1_U09.md"])
